# Databases
# sqlite — static SQLite (CLI + libsqlite3.a) from the amalgamation ebuild, not
# ::gentoo (which BDEPENDs tcl). THREADSAFE=0, no dlopen extensions, FTS5+JSON1.
# The `sqlite3` CLI is what the guestbook CGI shells out to for its INSERT/
# SELECT (DBD::SQLite's static_ext bake into monolith-perl was attempted and
# reverted — see the monolith-perl comment above — so libsqlite3.a/sqlite3.h
# are not currently consumed by anything in-tree; kept in the sysroot for a
# future DBD retry).
dev-db/monolith-sqlite

